exports[`CLI help interface for 'settings config-manager-layout' should be expected english 1`] = `
"Usage: frodo settings config-manager-layout [options]

Show or set the layout of a NEW config-manager tree. A tree records its own
layout in frodo-config-manager.json at its root, and an existing tree keeps that
layout: this setting is only read when a command creates a tree. "folders" keeps
each application in its own folder together with the objects it owns;
"kind-paths" keeps every object at the path of its own kind, as config-manager
did before applications.

Options:
  --folders         New trees get one folder per application (the default).
  --kind-paths      New trees keep every object at the path of its own kind, as
                    before applications.
  -h, --help        Help
  -hh, --help-more  Help with all options.
  -hhh, --help-all  Help with all options, environment variables, and usage
                    examples.
"
`;
